  "content": "# 世界传送门\n\n世界传送门可以创建自定义的世界传送门，用于在不同维度间旅行。您可以轻松地为自定义维度制作自己的传送门。\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ErdzJp2IOcg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Szmh1niQEFg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n### 重要提示\n\n- [0.0.8] 传送门框架的左上角和右上角将互换位置。\n- [0.0.10] 修复客户端问题并进行数据迁移。在更新前，请先使用此版本加载一次世界。\n\n## 功能特性\n\n- 无需客户端即可使用的自定义传送门。\n- 通过更改框架角落，将下界传送门转换为自定义传送门。\n- 水平传送门（>=0.0.8）。\n- 简单的配置和数据包支持。\n\n**本模组可以添加到现有的模组包或世界中，也可以从现有世界中轻松移除。请务必先备份您的世界。**\n\n### 计划中\n\n- 末地传送门模式。\n- 自定义传送门框架。\n- 自定义传送门生成的生物，不仅限于猪灵，或可禁用生成。\n- 自定义传送门最小生成高度。\n- 添加或更改传送门粒子效果。\n- 进入和离开传送门时执行命令或函数。\n- 基于生物群系、维度、高度、月相、时间和天气的目的地。\n- 基于玩家等级、饱和度，甚至经济系统和魔力的目的地。\n- 基于执行的命令或函数的目的地。\n- 基于维度和玩家权限的目的地限制。\n- 目的地覆盖游戏规则（gamerule）。\n- 支持经济、权限和任务模组。\n- 以及更多，包括正在开发的兼容模组。\n\n欢迎在 [GitHub Discussion](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/discussions) 或 [Discord](https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz) 上为世界传送门建议新功能。\n\n## 使用方法\n\n您可以通过配置文件或使用数据包进行数据驱动的方式配置此模组。\n\n<details>\n<summary>配置文件 (worldportal.json)</summary>\n\nID \"minecraft:example\" 可以是任何值，只要它是唯一的即可。\n\n```\n{\n    \"portals\": {\n        \"minecraft:example\": {\n            \"frame_top_right\": \"minecraft:gold_block\",\n            \"frame_top_left\": \"minecraft:iron_block\",\n            \"frame_bottom_right\": \"minecraft:iron_block\",\n            \"frame_bottom_left\": \"minecraft:gold_block\",\n            \"mode\": \"worldportal:default\",\n            \"destination\": \"customdimension:dimension\"\n        },\n        \"minecraft:example_horizontal\": {\n            \"frame_top_right\": \"minecraft:gold_block\",\n            \"frame_top_left\": \"minecraft:iron_block\",\n            \"frame_bottom_right\": \"minecraft:iron_block\",\n            \"frame_bottom_left\": \"minecraft:gold_block\",\n            \"mode\": \"worldportal:horizontal\",\n            \"destination\": \"customdimension:dimension_flat\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>数据包</summary>\n\n在您的数据包命名空间文件夹中，创建一个包含 \"portal\" 子文件夹的 \"worldportal\" 文件夹。在 portal 文件夹中，创建一个名为任意名称的 JSON 文件，内容如下：\n\n```\n{\n    \"frame_top_right\": \"minecraft:gold_block\",\n    \"frame_top_left\": \"minecraft:iron_block\",\n    \"frame_bottom_right\": \"minecraft:iron_block\",\n    \"frame_bottom_left\": \"minecraft:gold_block\",\n    \"mode\": \"worldportal:default\",\n    \"destination\": \"test:test\"\n}\n```\n-> data\\\\{namespace}\\worldportal\\portal\\\\{id}.json\n\n</details>\n\n目前，您只能自定义传送门框架角落和匹配的目的地维度。更多机制将在下次更新中添加，目前这已足够满足我的使用需求。\n\n## 兼容性\n\n- [Passengers Portal Fix](https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA)\n- **Create** 模组插件：[Create: Portal Integration](https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb)\n\n## 已知问题\n\n- [Radium]\n  请使用 Canary 以获得更好的模组兼容性，或手动禁用 \"mixin.ai.poi.fast_portals\"。\n\n目前没有报告新的兼容性问题或错误。请在 [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/issues) 上报告任何问题，以便修复。\n\n## 支持版本\n\n🟩 26.1-26.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2\n\n🟩 支持  \n🟥 停止支持  \n🟨 进行中  \n🟪 考虑中  \n\n## 重要说明\n\n此模组仅可用于创建自定义传送门。若要创建维度，您需要使用数据包或其他模组来实现。\n\n本模组旨在用于个人游戏调试、服务器定制和模组包制作。欢迎在模组包、视频、直播或其他类似媒体中使用。如果您喜欢此模组，请考虑在经济上支持我，我将不胜感激。\n\n<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"See me on GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Available on CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Watch me on YouTube\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Chat with me on Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Saweria\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/hJmXo78w\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/mgRpdg8r\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Link\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Miqj0P3U\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/cs5vil9i\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"More Cat Variants\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Passengers Portal Fix\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Create: Portal Integration\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/8SpfTsnq\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-superflatdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/superflatdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Superflat Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/y4wxFDPW\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-amplifieddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/amplifieddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Amplified Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Fo9Xodfg\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-largebiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/largebiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Large Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Y3EdVfom\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-mushroomfieldsdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/mushroomfieldsdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Mushroom Fields Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/ItO3yfpJ\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-beta173dimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/beta173dimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Beta 1.7.3 Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HkbFed4W\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-desertdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/desertdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Desert Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HW5SOOxi\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-badlandsbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/badlandsbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Badlands Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/63pdCQ3Y\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-forestbiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/forestbiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Forest Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/SrhObyPX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-thevoiddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/thevoiddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"The Void Dimension\"></a>\n</p>",
